WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Stand on one leg with a soft knee.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Hinge forward, sending the free leg back.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Keep hips square and spine long.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Return tall with control.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Switch sides.
